From 47e1488d7631064ecc46c82c98803ad912d8c3dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergey Fedorov <barracuda@macos-powerpc.org>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:39:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Tiger (10.4) specific fixes

Not safe for later systems; meant to be applied only on 10.4, after
0040-Tiger-specific-adjustments-to-CMakeLists.patch.

- CMakeLists: use nosupport keyboard/mouse (IOHIDManager is 10.5+),
  drop the unused DisplayServices private framework
- processing: use fork/exec instead of posix_spawn (10.5+)
- processes: no libproc; take the system-wide thread count from
  processor_set_statistics(PROCESSOR_SET_LOAD_INFO)
- top: stub out, per-process usage needs libproc
- smc_temps: IOConnectMethodStructureIStructureO instead of
  IOConnectCallStructMethod (10.5+)
- displayserver: CGDisplayRotation is 10.5+, report 0
- image: CGFloat does not exist yet, use float
---
 CMakeLists.txt                                |   6 +-
 src/common/apple/smc_temps.c                  |   7 +-
 src/common/impl/processing_linux.c            |   4 +-
 .../displayserver/displayserver_apple.c       |   2 +-
 src/detection/processes/processes_apple.c     |  17 ++-
 src/detection/top/top_apple.c                 | 112 +-----------------
 src/logo/image/imageio.c                      |   2 +-
 7 files changed, 24 insertions(+), 126 deletions(-)

